            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The multi-output-process "secondary copper conversion" delivers the co-products "metal values from electric waste, in blister-copper, at converter" and "lead, secondary, from electronic and electric scrap recycling, at plant". The product "metal values from electric waste, …" is an intermediary in the production of secondary gold from electric scrap and is not to be used by the LCA practitioner.  The flow "lead, …" is a by-product of this process that receives part of the burdens allocated. It must not be used to reflect lead.;
